#. あ、苗木！
#. 苗木もここを調べに来たの！？
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ah, Makoto! Are you here to look around, too?"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんも？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that what you're doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. だってさ、やっぱ気になるじゃん。
#. あのモノクマのドア…
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I can't help but wonder about that Monokuma\n"
"door..."
msgstr ""

#. 私ね、思ったんだ。
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So I figured..."
msgstr ""

#. 学園内のロックが解除されたなら、
#. あそこにも入れるはずだって！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...if all the doors in school had been unlocked, that\n"
"one should be open too, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. でもね…１人じゃ不安で開けられなかったんだよ…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Although...I couldn't bring myself to open it."
msgstr ""

#. だって、爆発とかしたら困るでしょ！？
#. だから苗木が開けてよ！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Cuz it might explode, right!? And that'd really suck.\n"
"So...you open it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、悪気はないんだろうけど、
#. ボクが爆発に巻き込まれるのは…いいのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure she didn't mean it, but she made it sound\n"
"like she was okay with *me* getting blown up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっきの音…
#. ボクの考えが当たってるとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did I just hear what I think I heard...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>モノクマ…？　だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that...Monokuma?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. じゃ、苗木、よろしくね！
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Thanks, Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと悪気はないんだろうけど…
#. ボクがどうなっても…いいのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She probably didn't mean it like that, but...doesn't\n"
"she care what happens to me?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お、おい…お前…！
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hey!"
msgstr ""

#. ガオーッ！！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Graar!"
msgstr ""

#. ガオーッ！　ドーナツよこせーッ！！
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Groooar! Gimme all yer donuts!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. もしかして…朝日奈さん？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that...you, Hina?"
msgstr ""

#. あれ？　バレた？
#. なんで！？
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What!? Aw man, busted! How did you know?"
msgstr ""

#. …て言うか、これってなんなの？
#. カメラ付きのラジコン？
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, what is this? Some kinda remote-control camera\n"
"kinda setup?"
msgstr ""

#. わからないで…操ってるの…？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You don't even know what you're controlling...?"
msgstr ""

#. いやぁ、こっちから何を操ってるのか見えなくて…
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well I mean, I can't really see anything from in here."
msgstr ""

#. あ、なんか発見！！
#. “自爆”ってボタンがあるよ！
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ah, guess what I found! A self-destruct button!"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんッ！　絶対に押しちゃダメだよ！
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Whatever you do, don't push it!"
msgstr ""

#. うーん、残念！！
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Aww maaaan!"
msgstr ""

#. …押す気だったの？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Were you seriously gonna push it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、とにかく、これでハッキリしたな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A-Anyway...I guess that settles it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>隣のモノクマ模様の部屋…
#. そこにあった操作パネルの意味が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The room with the Monokuma drawing on it, and the\n"
"control panel inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…とにかく、これでハッキリしたな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A-Anyway...I guess that settles it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あのモノクマ模様の部屋…
#. そこにあった操作パネルの意味が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The room with the Monokuma drawing on it, and the\n"
"control panel inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. 今は気にするのは止めよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... I don't have to worry about\n"
"this right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋中に設置された
#. バカみたいな数のモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's really a ridiculous number of monitors here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、このモニターで、
#. ボクらを監視していたんだな…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The mastermind has been watching us on these..."
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、開けてみるよ？
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, so...I guess I'll open it."
msgstr ""

#. あ、待って！　避難するから！
#. 爆発したら大変だし！
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Ah, wait! Lemme take cover first! I don't wanna get\n"
"exploded!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言いながら、朝日奈さんは全速力で、
#. 机の下へと滑り込んでいった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina raced over to a nearby desk and hid underneath\n"
"it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いいよー！　開けてー！！
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Okay! Go ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>悪気は…ないんだよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everything will be okay...right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、いくよ！
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Alright, here goes nothin'...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが力を込めると、
#. ドアは意外なほど簡単に開いた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I threw all my weight into it, but the door opened\n"
"much easier than I expected.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマに…話しかけてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should try and talk to Monokuma...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モニターとは違う…
#. 放送を受信してるテレビだ…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's not like the other monitors. It's a normal TV,\n"
"set up to receive the live broadcast..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この<CLT><CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT><CLT 4>が…
#. 完全生中継により全国ネットで放送中だなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Apparently this \"<CLT><CLT 3>killing game<CLT><CLT 4>\" is being broadcast\n"
"live across the world...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は考えないようにしよう。
#. また…精神が軋む音が聞こえてきそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thinking about it is making my mind start to creak\n"
"again. So...I'd better stop.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>パソコンが何台も並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of computers all lined up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴが入ってたノートパソコンとは違って、
#. かなり高性能みたいだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They look like high-performance PCs. Nothing like the\n"
"ancient laptop Alter Ego was installed on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は…このパソコンでネットワークに繋いで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This must be what the mastermind uses to connect to\n"
"the network...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“コロシアイ学園生活”生放送の反響でも…
#. 見ていたのかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even though I'm living it, I might have watched the\n"
"broadcast of the killing game myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木！
#. そっちは廊下に出るドアだよ！
msgctxt "0051 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Makoto! That leads back out into the hallway!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで出ていっても仕方ないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point in me leaving now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
